Here is a complete, modern product landing page designed for maximum conversion. 

The layout starts with an eye-catching, high-converting gradient hero banner introducing the product, flows into a clean three-column feature grid detailing the key benefits, showcases social proof with a high-rating customer testimonial, and concludes with a prominent call-to-action block.

First, we establish the UI surface:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "product-landing-page",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-marketing-commerce.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

Next, we render the page sections. As per the top-down ordering guidelines, the primary root component is rendered first, followed sequentially by the subsequent sections down the page:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "product-landing-page",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "gradient_hero",
        "title": "Empower Your Workflow",
        "subtitle": "The all-in-one platform designed to streamline your team's productivity, automate busywork, and scale your operations effortlessly.",
        "badge": "INTRODUCING WORKFLOW OS",
        "cta_label": "Get Started Free",
        "cta_url": "https://example.com/signup"
      },
      {
        "id": "features-section",
        "component": "feature_grid",
        "heading": "Everything you need to succeed",
        "description": "Powerful, modern features built directly into your daily workspace so you can focus on building great things.",
        "columns": 3,
        "features": [
          {
            "icon": "⚡",
            "title": "Lightning Fast",
            "description": "Experience zero latency with our globally distributed real-time sync technology.",
            "badge": "New"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🔒",
            "title": "Bank-Grade Security",
            "description": "Your data is protected with end-to-end encryption, regular auditing, and SOC2 compliance."
          },
          {
            "icon": "🤖",
            "title": "AI-Powered Automation",
            "description": "Let AI handle your repetitive tasks, follow-ups, and data entries automatically."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "customer-testimonial",
        "component": "testimonial_card",
        "text": "Workflow OS completely transformed how our design agency operates. We successfully consolidated four separate tools and saved over 15 hours a week per creator on project management alone!",
        "author_name": "Sarah Jenkins",
        "author_title": "Creative Director, PixelCraft Agency",
        "author_avatar_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&h=150&q=80",
        "rating": 5
      },
      {
        "id": "cta-footer",
        "component": "cta_section",
        "heading": "Ready to revolutionize your work?",
        "body": "Join over 10,000+ teams who are already building the future of their businesses with Workflow OS. Start your 14-day free trial today.",
        "primary_cta": {
          "label": "Start Your Free Trial",
          "url": "https://example.com/register"
        },
        "secondary_cta": {
          "label": "Book a Demo",
          "url": "https://example.com/demo"
        },
        "background": "#0f172a"
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
